    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.1#p1-ba12b52d",
     "text": "Read Ezr 7:1-28.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Artaxerxes the king",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ezr 7:1-28",
       "ref": "EZR.7.1-28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.13",
   "range": "EZR.8.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "278144eb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.13#p1-278144eb",
     "text": "That came to go with Ezra.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "last sons of Adonikam"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.15",
   "range": "EZR.8.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a3e8fb79",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.15#p1-a3e8fb79",
     "text": "To that place of Euphrates, where the Ahava river enters it.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "river that runneth to Ahava"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.17",
   "range": "EZR.8.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b0c95662",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.17#p1-b0c95662",
     "text": "He was the chief teacher of the law to the Levites.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "chief at the place Casiphia"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.21",
   "range": "EZR.8.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "93322a38",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.21#p1-93322a38",
     "text": "He shows that the purpose of fasting is to humble the body to the spirit, which must proceed from the heart that is touched, or else it is hypocrisy.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "ourselves before our God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.22",
   "range": "EZR.8.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a962f488",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.22#p1-a962f488",
     "text": "He thought it better to commit himself to the protection of God, than by seeking these ordinary means to give others a reason to think that he doubted God's power.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "ashamed to require of the king"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.26",
   "range": "EZR.8.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e6c5b17f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.26#p1-e6c5b17f",
     "text": "Read 1Ki 9:14.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "talents of silver",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 9:14",
       "ref": "1KI.9.14"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.27",
   "range": "EZR.8.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9b48861e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.27#p1-9b48861e",
     "text": "Read Ezr 2:69.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "drams",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ezr 2:69",
       "ref": "EZR.2.69"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.31",
   "range": "EZR.8.31",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "73e2e5eb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.31#p1-73e2e5eb",
     "text": "This declared that their journey was full of danger and yet God delivered them according to their prayer.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "wait by the way"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EZR.8.33",
   "range": "EZR.8.33",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6808c667",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EZR.8.33#p1-6808c667",
     "text": "This was a token of a good conscience and of his integrity that he would have witnesses of his fidelity.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "Levites"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
